      "additionalProperties": false,
      "title": "dispatch-job-facts@1",
      "description": "Job-scoped metadata and result observations, never a round-level effect outcome or history-any invocation summary. scope contains only job. No outcome, not_sent, submit_invoked or anyInvoke here. Optional readonly_verified and admission_error describe actual admission/readonly observations, not a job effect outcome. frozen is the conservative no-resend control. awaiting_disposition is the observed outstanding effect disposition/unknown-request state, sourced from isFrozen(events). Both are independent job-scoped observations, not mirrors; neither establishes a physical effect."
    },
